{"title":"Vape Coils \u0026 Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eOur selection of vape coils includes options for all styles of e-cigarette coils and pod kits, with compatible coils for sub ohm devices, classic setups and pod kits all incorporated into our expansive range. Shop \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/\" title=\"vape\"\u003evape \u003c\/a\u003ecoils \u0026amp; pods today and pick up a vape coil which perfectly suits your needs from the best brands in the industry, including Caliburn, Smok, Vaporesso and many more.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-koko-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Caliburn Koko Replacement Pods – 4 Pcs","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn KOKO Replacement Pods are designed for the Uwell Caliburn koko pod system Featuring a 2ml nic salt e-liquid capacity and an atomizer resistance of 1.2 ohm. Each KOKO re-fillable pod features a magnetic connection and fits smoothly into the housing. The housing that holds the pod in place has a side view window which allows users to casually check their juice level without removing the pod itself.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNote: The original Caliburn Replacement Pods are compatible with the KOKO device.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Specifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn KOKO Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml E-Liquid Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRe-Fillable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3.5mm Fill Ports\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Ports\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2 ohm Atomizer Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMinimum Fill Line\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGold Plated Contacts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Includes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eOne Pack of Four (4) 1.2 ohm Caliburn Pod.","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531606859831,"sku":"U Cali Koko Replace Pods - 4 pcs","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Uwell-Caliburn-Koko-Replacement-Pods.jpg?v=1741702523"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-a2s-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Caliburn A2S Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Caliburn A2S Pods (4-Pack), featuring a 2mL capacity, side fill system, and an integrated 1.2ohm meshed coil for maximum flavor. Cross-compatible with the original Caliburn A2 Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a2s-pod-system\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn A2s Pod System\"\u003eUwell Caliburn A2S Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a2-15w-pod-system\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn A2 Pod System\"\u003eUwell Caliburn A2 Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a2-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn A2 Replacement Pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn A2 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell CALIBURN A2S Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1.2ohm A2S Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with 0.9ohm A2 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of four (4)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531626881079,"sku":"U Cali A2S Replace Pods","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_caliburn_a2_side_refilling_pod_-_accessories_-_box-min.png?v=1741703112"},{"product_id":"uwell-yearn-neat-2-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Yearn Neat 2 Replacement Pods","description":"Check out the Uwell YEARN NEAT 2 Replacement Pods, featuring a 2mL capacity, 0.9ohm integrated UN2 Meshed H Coil, and Pro-FOCS flavor technology.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell YEARN NEAT 2 Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 0.9ohm UN2-Meshed H Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Pro-FOCS Flavor Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eMake sure to properly prime each coils and pods before use.\u003cbr\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531629043767,"sku":"U Yearn Neat 2 Replace Pods","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_yearn_neat_2_-_refillable_pods_-_fecral_0.9_ohm.png?v=1741703391"},{"product_id":"uwell-yearn-replacement-pod-cartridges","title":"Uwell Yearn Replacement Pod Cartridges","description":"\u003cp\u003eWe asked Uwell to release refillable pod cartridges for the Uwell Yearn pod device because we love it so much and now they're here - a refillable (empty) alternative to the pre-filled pods for the Yearn.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Yearn has been our best selling closed pod device and now it's open to use with all your favourite liquids! Amazing, right?!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecs:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePacket of 4\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.5 ml Capacity with side fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.4 Ohm Resistance Cotton Vertical Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWe strongly suggest the use of 50\/50 PG\/VG salt based e-liquids for this device to ensure your pods don't burn out prematurely.\u003c\/strong\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531629076535,"sku":"U Yearn Replace Pod Cartridges","price":1250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell-yearn-replacement-pod-cartridges-4-pack.jpg?v=1741703396"},{"product_id":"uwell-sculptor-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Sculptor Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Sculptor Pods (2-Pack), featuring a 1.6mL capacity, side fill system, and \u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1.2ohm\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eintegrated coil for delicious flavor and vapor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-sculptor-11w-pod-system\" title=\"Uwell Sculptor Pod System\"\u003eUwell Sculptor 11W Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Sculptor Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 1.6mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill: Side Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil: Integrated 1.2ohm Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of two (2)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531764834359,"sku":"U Sculptor Replace Pods","price":1149.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_sculptor_refillable_pod_accessories_box.png?v=1741709759"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-xros-replacement-pods","title":"Vaporesso XROS Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Vaporesso XROS Pods (4-PACK), featuring 2mL \u0026amp;amp; 3mL refillable pods, a hidden top-fill system, and utilizes a mesh coil heating structure. Constructed with a transparent juice viewing window, the XROS replacement pods allow for the user to check juice levels without removing the pod. Equipped with an integrated mesh coil, the XROS pods consist of a 0.8ohm and 1.2ohm mesh coil pod, facilitating a hidden top fill system revealed by taking off the mouthpiece. At the base is a magnetic pod connection, allowing quick and easy coil replacements while securing the pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-xros-nano-pod-system\" title=\"Vaporesso xros nano pod system\"\u003eVaporesso XROS Nano Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-xros-16w-pod-system\" title=\"Vaporesso xros 16w pod system\"\u003eVaporesso XROS Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso XROS Replacement Pods Features\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL \u0026amp;amp; 3mL Pod Capacity Options\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Hidden By Mouthpiece\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTransparent Juice Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso XROS Pod Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.6ohm XROS Mesh Pods (2mL)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.6ohm XROS Mesh Pods (3mL)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.7ohm XROS Mesh Pods (2mL)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm XROS Mesh Pods (2mL)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm XROS Mesh Pods (3mL)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.0ohm XROS Mesh Pods (2mL)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm XROS Mesh Pods (2mL)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of two (2) \/ four (4).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"XROS Replacement Pods 0.6ohm (4 Pack)","offer_id":41531766439991,"sku":"69d25d432875b","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"XROS Replacement Pods 1.0ohm (4 Pack)","offer_id":41531766472759,"sku":"69d25d44e721a","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"XROS Replacement Pods 1.2ohm (4 Pack)","offer_id":41531766505527,"sku":"69d25d458f5cb","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"XROS Replacement Pods 0.7ohm (4 Pack)","offer_id":41531766538295,"sku":"69d25d43bc0bf","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"XROS Replacement Pods 0.8ohm (4 Pack)","offer_id":41531766571063,"sku":"69d25d445ac46","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_xros_replacement_pods_-_boxes.jpg?v=1741709825"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-zero-s-replacement-pods","title":"Vaporesso Zero S Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover Vaporesso Zero S Pods \u003cstrong\u003e(2-Pack)\u003c\/strong\u003e, featuring a 2mL capacity, integrated 1.2ohm coil, and top filled behind the removeable mouthpiece. Cross-compatible with the original ZERO and ZERO 2.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-zero-2-top-filling-pod-system\" title=\"Vaporesso Zero 2 Top Filling Pod System\"\u003eVaporesso Zero Top Filling Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-zero-2-pod-system\" title=\"Vaporesso Zero 2 Pod System\"\u003eVaporesso Zero 2 Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-renova-zero-pod-system\" title=\"Vaporesso Zero Pod System\"\u003eVaporesso Zero Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"1.0ohm Mesh Zero S Pod","offer_id":41531767881783,"sku":"69d25d45cead1","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"1.2ohm Mesh Zero S Pod","offer_id":41531767914551,"sku":"69d25d466ad40","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_-_zero_s_mesh_pod_-_accessories_-_box.png?v=1741709886"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-zero-2-replacement-pods","title":"Vaporesso Zero 2 Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Vaporesso ZERO 2 Replacement Pods, featuring a 3mL capacity, bottom press-to-fill system, and comes in a 1.0ohm Mesh or 1.3ohm CCELL Pod.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso ZERO 2 Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottom Press-To-Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.0ohm Mesh Coil Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.3ohm CCELL Coil Pod ( better for regular smokers )\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of two (2)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\nMake sure to properly prime each coils and pods before use.","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Mesh Version Pods","offer_id":41531768078391,"sku":"69d25d4979f28","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Ccell Version Pods","offer_id":41531768111159,"sku":"69d25d48db3e4","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_-_zero_2_pods_-_accessories_-_all_types.png?v=1741709899"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-renova-zero-pod-cartridge","title":"Vaporesso Renova Zero Vape Pod Cartridge","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Vaporesso Renova ZERO Vape Replacement Pods are specially designed for the ZERO Ultra Portable System, featuring a PTCG-constructed shell with 2mL juice capability alongside CCELL Coil with ceramic technology. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe utilization of ceramic heating elements delivers tremendous aroma of flavors, with reduction in spit-back and dry hit for longer longevity. \u003cem\u003eComes in pack of 2.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-sheets-userformat='{\"2\":4480,\"10\":2,\"11\":4,\"15\":\"arial,sans,sans-serif\"}' data-sheets-value='{\"1\":2,\"2\":\"Vaporesso Nexus Replacement Coil Features:\\n1.0ohm NX CCELL Coil - rated for 7-12W\\n1.0ohm NX Coil - rated for 7-12W (Traditional Cotton)\\nOrganic Cotton\\nStainless Steel Structure\"}'\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso ZERO Replacement Pod Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003e2 pcs in a box\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1.3ohm CCELL Coil - rated for 9\/10.5\/12.5W\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1.0ohm MESH Coil - rated for 9\/11\/13W\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePCTG Construction\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePush-to-Fill Design (PTF)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eOrganic Cotton\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eProprietary Connection\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n