l E-Liquid Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-In Coil Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePush Fit Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.9 Ohm Coil Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can easily refill the Smok Novo 2X just remove the mouthpiece to reveal the e-liquid port and fill it with your favourite e-liquid. This 0.9 Ohm pod uses a built-in mesh coil, which means that e-liquid is more effectively vaporised to improve flavour production. These pods are ideal for creating an MTL (Mouth To Lung) inhale and are best paired with e-liquids that are mixed with 50% PG or are PG heavy.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3 x Smok Novo 2X replacement pods\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"0.9ohm Meshed","offer_id":41531771093047,"sku":"30","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.8ohm Meshed","offer_id":41531771125815,"sku":"69d25d4ec2b53","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok-novo-2x-pods-min.jpg?v=1741710035"},{"product_id":"smok-novo-4-empty-pods","title":"Smok Novo 4 Empty Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe SMOK NOVO 4 Replacement Pods are a set of pods crafted for the SMOK NOVO 4 Pod System, implementing a bottom press-fit coil installation method and features a large mouthpiece for drip tip style inhalation to fully enjoy the vaping experience provided by the NOVO 4 Pod System.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQUICK LINKS:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca title=\"Smok Novo 4 Kit\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-novo-4-25w-pod-kit\"\u003eSMOK Novo 4 Kit | 25w\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFEATURES:\u003c\/strong\u