eel P1 Replace Pods","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_popreel_p1_pod_cartridge_-_accessories_-_box.png?v=1741710177"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Caliburn G Replacement Pods","description":"Check out the Uwell Caliburn G Replacement Pods, a leakproof 2mL capacity refillable pod, delivering delicious flavor and vapor from your favorite eJuice.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eUwell CALIBURN G Replacement Pods Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn G Pod Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Fill Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.0ohm Caliburn G Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\nMake sure to properly prime each coils and pods before use.","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652492501047,"sku":"U Cali G Replace Pods","price":1050.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_g_pods_-_packaging.png?v=1746632966"},{"product_id":"caliburn-g3-replacement-pods","title":"Caliburn G3 Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn G3 refillable pods are designed for use with the Uwell Caliburn G3 vape kit. They can hold up to 2ml of e-liquid and you can pair them with any flavour or nicotine strength you like, so you can try different options and see what suits you best. The pods contain a built-in coil and are designed for MTL (Mouth To Lung) and RDTL (Restricted Direct To Lung) vaping.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRefillable 2ml Pods\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop-Filling\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMTL Vaping\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible With 50\/50 And High PG E-Liquids\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Caliburn G3 pods feature an easy top-filling design, so you can refill them without even having to remove them from your device. To swap between an RDTL and MTL inhale, you can just switch between the 0.6 Ohm, 0.9 Ohm and 1.2 Ohm pods. When the built-in coil has burnt out, all you have to do is replace the entire pod, so no more fiddly coil changes. When it comes to choosing an e-liquid, we suggest pairing these pods with a 50% VG vape juice or higher PG option.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4 x Uwell Caliburn G3 2ml Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"0.6 OHM MESHED","offer_id":41652492533815,"sku":"U Cali G3 Replace pods - 0.6 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.9 OHM MESHED","offer_id":41652492566583,"sku":"U Cali G3 Replace pods - 0.9 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"1.2 OHM MESHED","offer_id":41652492599351,"sku":"U Cali G3 Replace pods - 1.2 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell-caliburn-g3-replacement-pods-min.jpg?v=1746632970"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g2-replacement-coils","title":"Uwell Caliburn G2 Replacement Coils","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the Uwell Caliburn G2 Replacement Coils, featuring a 0.8ohm and 1.2ohm mesh coil for delivering delicious vapor and flavor from your favourite e Juice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g