3e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK RPM \u0026amp; Nord Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.3ohm RPM MTL Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.4ohm RPM Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm RPM DC MTL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.6ohm RPM Triple Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.0ohm RPM SC Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm RPM Quartz Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRPM and Nord Pod Compatibility Options\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThreaded Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK RPM RBA Coil Features \u0026amp; Specification:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK RPM RBA Head (Rebuildable Atomizer Head)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFeatures and Specs:\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDesigned for the SMOK RPM40 Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncludes (1) Single Coil 0.6ohm (Pre-installed)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncludes Carrying Case, Screwdriver and Spare Parts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"0.3ohm RPM MTL Mesh Coil","offer_id":41673691856951,"sku":"69d25f6b7af77","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0.4ohm RPM Mesh Coil","offer_id":41673691889719,"sku":"69d25f6c9e76f","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.6ohm RPM Triple Coil","offer_id":41673691922487,"sku":"69d25f6dc26f6","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.8ohm RPM DC MTL","offer_id":41673691955255,"sku":"69d25f6e61fb2","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"1.0ohm RPM SC Coil","offer_id":41673691988023,"sku":"69d25f6ee4126","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"1.2ohm RPM Quartz Coil","offer_id":41673692020791,"sku":"69d25f6f882c3","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.6ohm RPM RBA Coil","offer_id":41673692053559,"sku":"69d25f6d3b2d7","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok-rpm-replacement-coils-5pcs.jpg?v=1747875507"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-gtx-replacement-coil-series","title":"Vaporesso GTX Replacement Coil Series (5-Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe GTX Mesh and GTX-2 coils from Vaporesso are original replacement coils designed for even better flavor and vapor, they come in a huge range of resistances to suit a multitude of vaping styles.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe GTX \u0026amp; GTX-2 coils are compatible with the following Vaporesso devices: Swag PX80, Luxe PM40 (0.6ohm, 0.8ohm, 1.2ohm Mesh \u0026amp; Regular Coils ONLY), Gen Nano 80W, Xiron, GTX One, GTX Tank (18 \u0026amp; 22) Target PM80, Target PM80 SE and Target PM30.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Vaporesso GTX 0.2 Ohm Mesh Coil:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.2 Ohm Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMesh Heating Element\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e45-60W Resistance Range\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with pre-mixed 10ml vape juice.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Vaporesso GTX 0.3 Ohm Mesh Coil:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.3 Ohm Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMesh Heating Element\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e32-45W Resistance Range\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with pre-mixed vape juice.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Vaporesso GTX 0.6 Ohm Mesh Coil:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.6 Ohm Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMesh Heating Element\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20-30W Resistance Range\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with pre-mixed vape juice.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Vaporesso GTX 0.8 Ohm Mesh Coil:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8 Ohm Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMesh Heating Element\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e12-20W Resistance Range\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with pre-mixed vape juice with higher nicotine content and nic salts.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Vaporesso GTX 1.2 Ohm Mesh Coil:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2 Ohm Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMesh Heating Element\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e7-11W Resistance Range\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with nic salts.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Vaporesso GTX 1.2 Ohm Regular Coil:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2 Ohm Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWire Heating Element\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e8-12W Resistance Range\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with nic salts.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Vaporesso GTX RBA Coil:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFeCrAI\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.7 Ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDIY Heating Element\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRestricted Direct Lung\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Vaporesso GTX-2 0.6 Ohm Mesh Coil:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.6 Ohm Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMesh Heating Element\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20-30W Resistance Range\u003c\