esh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of three (3)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775198240823,"sku":"S IGEE Replace Pods","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_-_igee_pod_-_accessories_-_box.png?v=1752510873"},{"product_id":"smok-lp2-replacement-coils","title":"SMOK LP2 Replacement Coils","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the SMOK LP2 Replacement Coils, featuring a 0.23ohm and 0.6ohm in Meshed and Dual Coil options, to deliver delicious vapor in MTL or DL fashion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-rpm-4-60w-pod-system\" title=\"RPM 4 Kit\"\u003eRPM 4 Kit\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK LP2 Replacement Coils Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK LP2 Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.23ohm LP2 Meshed Coils - rated for 20-45W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.6ohm LP2 DC Coils - rated for 15-25W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of five (5).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Meshed 0.23ohm DL","offer_id":41775198306359,"sku":"S LP2 Replace Coils - Meshed 0.23 Ohm DL","price":1960.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"DC 0.6ohm MTL","offer_id":41775198339127,"sku":"S LP2 Replace Coils - DC 0.6ohm MTL","price":1960.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_lp2_coil_coils_default.png?v=1752510878"},{"product_id":"smok-nord-2-replacement-pods","title":"SMOK Nord 2 Replacement Pods (no coils included)","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the SMOK NORD 2 Replacement Pods, featuring a 4.5mL side filled capacity, offering a NORD and RPM Pod Variant that supports the respective coil series, and is outfitted with an ergonomic mouthpiece for comfortable usage and vapor delivery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-nord-2-40w-pod-system\" title=\"SMOK Nord 2 Pod System\"\u003eSMOK NORD 2 Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-nord-replacement-coils\" title=\"SMOK Nord Replacement Coils\"\u003eSMOK NORD Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK Nord 2 Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4.5mL NORD Pod - Supports NORD Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4.5mL RPM Pod - Supports RPM Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eErgonomic Mouthpiece\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK Nord \u0026amp; RPM Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.4ohm RPM Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm Nord DC MTL Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlug 'n' Play Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775198371895,"sku":"S Nord 2 Replace Pods (no coils included)","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_nord_2_replacement_pods_-_box.jpg?v=1752510881"},{"product_id":"smok-nord-4-replacement-pods","title":"SMOK Nord 4 RPM Replacement Pods","description":"Shop the SMOK nord 4 Replacement Pods, featuring a 4.5mL capacity, RPM and RPM 2 respective coil compatibility, and works with eJuice or nicotine salts.\u