 before use.","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"0.8ohm DC MTL Pod","offer_id":41775198502967,"sku":"Smok Nfix Replacement Pods Kenya","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.8ohm Meshed Pod","offer_id":41775198535735,"sku":"Smok Nfix Replacement Pods Kenya-2","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_nfix_replacement_pods.jpg?v=1752510889"},{"product_id":"smok-nfix-pro-replacement-pods","title":"SMOK NFIX Pro Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the SMOK NFIX Pro Replacement Pods, featuring a 2mL capacity, side fill system, and utilizes the LP1 Coil Series to create unrivaled vapor and flavor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-lp1-replacement-coils\" title=\"SMOK LP1 Replacement Coil\"\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-lp1-replacement-coils\" title=\"SMOK LP1 Replacement Coil\"\u003eSMOK LP1 Coil Series\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK NFIX PRO Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Refillable Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLP1 Mesh Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.9ohm LP1 Mesh Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm LP1 Mesh Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress-Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake sure to properly prime each coils and pods before use.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775198568503,"sku":"S NFIX Pro Replace Pods","price":1760.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_-_nfix_pro_empty_pod_-_accessories.png?v=1752510894"},{"product_id":"smok-solus-replacement-pod","title":"Smok Solus Replacement Pod","description":"\u003cp\u003eSmok Solus Replacement Pod offers 2.5ml vape juice capacity, uses nic salt ejuices for MTL and RDL vaping. Made from PCTG, draw-activated, compatible with Smok Solus 2 Kit. Smok Solus 2 features a magnetic connection, moreover, you can refill from the side slot. It will be highly effective for quitting smoking and compatible with e-liquids that contain nicotine salts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures and Specifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCapacity: 2ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.8-3.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 0.9ohm Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMTL and RDL Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFit For SMOK SOLUS 2 and SMOK Solus GBox Kit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePerfect For Nic Salt E-juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuantity: 3pcs\/pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWHAT'S IN THE BOX:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThree (3) SMOK Solus 2 \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/replacement-pods\" title=\"replacement pods\"\u003eReplacement Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775198601271,"sku":"S Solus Replace Pod","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok-solus-replacement-pod-meshed-min.jpg?v=1752510898"},{"product_id":"smok-ofrf-nexmesh-replacement-coils","title":"SMOK OFRF NexMESH Replacement Coils","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the SMOK OFRF NexMesh Pod Coils (5-Pack), offering a 0.4ohm stainless steel or DC MTL option, bottom press-fit connection, and can be used in a MTL or DTL option.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-ofrf-nexmesh-30w-pod-system\" title=\"SMOK OFRF NexMesh Pod System\"\u003eSMOK OFRF NexMesh Pod Kit\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK OFRF NexMesh Replacement Coils Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNexMesh Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.4ohm SS316 Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.4ohm DC MTL Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePressFit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of five (5).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"0.4ohm DT MTL Coils","offer_id":41775206563895,"sku":"S OFRF NexMESH Replace Coils - 0.4 ohm DT MTL Coils","price":1899.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0.4ohm SS316L Coils","offer_id":41775206596663,"sku":"S OFRF NexMESH Replace Coils - 0.4 ohm SS316L Coils","price":1899.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_ofrf_nexmesh_pod_replacement_coils_-_blister_pack_and_box_-_0.4ohm_dc_mtl_coils.jpg?v=1752511634"},{"product_id":"smok-v12-price-replacement-coils-all-resistance","title":"SMOK V12 Price\/RBA Replacement Coils ( All Resistance )","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Smok TFV12 Prince Replacement Coils are unrivaled performance atomizer cores introduced with the amazing TFV12 Cloud Beast Prince Tank. Designed for mid-wattage configurations, it offers phenomenal flavor recreation and excellent vapor production. The TFV12 Prince introduces a variety of exotic configurations, such as V12 Prince Max Mesh, V12 Prince Dual Mesh, V12 Prince Triple Mesh, and Prince X2 Clapton.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCoil packs comes in a pack of (3) three replacement coils\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is offered in a variety of different sub-ohm coils: V12 Prince-T10, V12 Prince-X6, V12 Prince-Q4, and V12 Prince-M4. The V12 Prince-T10 is the flagship atomizer technology, featuring a 0.12ohm within a Decuple coil cylinder to provide unsurpassed amount of vapor capability, with a wattage range of 60 to 120W.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor building enthusiasts, SMOKTech introduces a dynamic V12 Prince-RBA with pre-installed clapton coils. It features a two-post, dual terminal build deck for user-friendly configurations that accommodates a wide range of coil structures for users to match the sophisticated power of the Smok TFV12 Prince tank.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSMOK TFV12 Prince Replacement Coils Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerformance Enhanced Coil Structure\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eV12-T10 Decuple coil Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.12 ohm rated for 60-120W, recommended 80-110W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eV12-T6 Sextuple Coil Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.17ohm rated for 90-320W, recommended 120-180W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eV12 RBA Rebuildable Head\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTwo-Post, Dual Terminal Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Coil Configurations\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eV12 Prince Dual Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.2ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRated for 70-120W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRecommended 85-105W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"V12 Prince Mesh","offer_id":41775207055415,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 Prince Mesh","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 Prince - X6","offer_id":41775207088183,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 Prince - X6","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 Prince - T10","offer_id":41775207120951,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 Prince - T10","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"V12 Prince Max Mesh","offer_id":41775207153719,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 Prince Max Mesh","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 RBA","offer_id":41775207186487,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 RBA","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 RBA-T","offer_id":41775207219255,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 RBA-T","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 - X4","offer_id":41775207252023,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 - X4","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 - Q4","offer_id":41775207284791,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 Q4","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 - T6","offer_id":41775207317559,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 T6","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/SMOK-V12-Prince-MESH-Coils.jpg?v=1752511677"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-gtx-series-replacement-pods","title":"Vaporesso GTX Series Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn one simple GTX Pod you get all these features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSecure magnetic connection - don’t worry about the GTX Pod popping off accidentally.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBig clouds and delicious flavour from your e-liquid with Vaporesso GTX Coils.\u003cbr\u003eQuick fire.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop fill - simple quarter turn of top cap through silicone-covered port hole.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSS leak-resistant technology in the pod which stands for: seal comprehensively with the o-rings that keep the air pressure in for a tighter draw store safely with extra seal that may prevent leaking while not in use saturate properly via the large coil openings to the cotton to avoid burning the coil or getting a dry hit (aka helps prime coil and keep the cotton wet while vaping).\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuick coil change - simply pull the old coil out and plug in the new one\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable airflow - tighten or loosen your air intake. Perfect for direct-lung (DL) vaping (where you inhale vapour directly to the lungs from the drip tip)!\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVaporesso GTX Pod 26 5 ml (TPD)\u003cbr\u003eVaporesso GTX Pod 22 3.5 ml (TPD)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe GTX 22 pod is 39.5 mm in height and 22.5 mm in diameter.\u003cbr\u003eThe GTX 26 pod is 40.5 mm in height and 26 mm in diameter.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eGTX Pod 22 is designed for use in the Vaporesso GTX 40 Pod kit.\u003cbr\u003eGTX Pod 26 is designed for use in the Vaporesso GTX 80 Pod kit and Target 80 kit.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Vaporesso GTX replacement pods are recommended for use with both High VG 70+ (DTL), 50\/50 Freebase (MTL) and Nic Salt (MTL) E-Liquids.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"GTX 22 3.5ML","offer_id":41775207448631,"sku":"V GTX Series Replace Pods GTX 22 3.5 ml","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"GTX 26 5ML","offer_id":41775207481399,"sku":"V GTX Series Replace Pods GTX 26 5 ml","price":1950.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso-gtx-replacement-pod-min.jpg?v=1752511690"},{"product_id":"voopoo-tpp-dm1-dm2-replacement-coils","title":"VooPoo TPP-DM Replacement Coils","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Voopoo TPP Replacement Coils, featuring a mesh heating element to deliver rapid heating, unlocking true flavor from your favorite eJuice.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO DRAG 3 Starter Kit\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO DRAG X Plus Kit\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO DRAG X Pro Kit\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO DRAG X Plus Pro Kit\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO Argus XT Kit (MAAT Edition Only)\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO Argus MT Kit (MAAT Edition Only)\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO TPP-X Pod Tank\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO TPP Pod Tank\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVOOPOO TPP Pod Tank 2\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVoopoo TPP Replacement Coils Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoopoo TPP Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.15ohm TPP-DM1 Coils - rated for 60-80W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.2ohm TPP-DM2 Coils - rated for 40-60W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.15ohm TPP-DM3 Coils - rated for 80-100W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.3ohm TPP-DM4 Coils - rated for 32-40W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of three (3).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Voopoo","offers":[{"title":"0.15ohm TPP-DM1 Coils","offer_id":41775207645239,"sku":"Voopoo TPP-DM Replace Coils - 0.15 ohm DM1 Coils","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0.2ohm TPP-DM2 Coils","offer_id":41775207678007,"sku":"Voopoo TPP-DM Replace Coils - 0.2 ohm DM2 Coils","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.15ohm TPP-DM3 Coils","offer_id":41775207710775,"sku":"Voopoo TPP-DM Replace Coils - 0.15 ohm DM3 Coils","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.3ohm TPP-DM4 Coils","offer_id":41775207743543,"sku":"Voopoo TPP-DM Replace Coils - 0.3 ohm DM4 Coils","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/voopoo-tpp-dm1-coils.jpg?v=1752511736"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-q-replacement-pods","title":"Vaporesso Luxe Q Replacement Pods -4 pack","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the Vaporesso LUXE Q Replacement Pods, featuring a 2mL capacity, integrated 0.8ohm or 1.2ohm coils, and offers a leak-free top fill system.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso LUXE Q Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-Juice Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSS Leak-Resistant Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 0.8ohm Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1.2ohm Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMake sure to properly prime each coils and pods before use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"0.8ohm LUXE Q Mesh Pod","offer_id":41775207809079,"sku":"V Luxe Q Replace Pods -4 pack - 0.8 ohm","price":1985.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"1.2ohm LUXE Q Mesh Pod","offer_id":41775207841847,"sku":"V Luxe Q Replace Pods -4 pack - 1.2 ohm","price":1985.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_luxe_q_replacement_pods_boxes.png?v=1752511743"},{"product_id":"voopoo-drag-nano-replacement-pods","title":"VooPoo S1 Drag Nano Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe VOOPOO POD-S1 Replacement Pods are a set of food-grade 1.0mL plastic pods, top filled, with an integrated coil resistance of 1.8ohms to vaporize complex nicotine salt juices. Designed specifically for the Voopoo Drag Nano Vape and VOOPOO ALPHA ZIP Pod Kit.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVOOPOO DRAG Nano Replacement Pod Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.8ohm POD-S1 Cartridge - 1.0mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.5ohm DRAG NANO P1 Cartridge - 1.6mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Coil Resistance: 1.8ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFood-Grade Plastic Pod Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Silicone Plug\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Voopoo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775207907383,"sku":"VooPoo S1 Drag Nano Replacement Pods","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/voopoo_drag_nano_pod-s1_replacement_pods.jpg?v=1752511750"},{"product_id":"caliburn-a3s-pods","title":"Caliburn A3S Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience enhanced vaping convenience with the Uwell Caliburn A3S Replacement Pods. Each pod boasts a 2mL refillable capacity, allowing you to enjoy your favorite eJuices without frequent refills. Crafted from durable PCTG material, these pods are built to last. The user-friendly side fill system makes refilling a breeze. These pods come with integrated 0.8ohm or 1.0ohm coils for exceptional flavor delivery. Thanks to the magnetic connection, swapping out these pods is quick and hassle-free.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConstruction: PCTG\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill-System: Side Fill System\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Support: Integrated Coil\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of four (4)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"0.8 OHM MESHED","offer_id":41775207972919,"sku":"Cali A3S Replace Pods - 0.8 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"1.0 OHM MESHED","offer_id":41775208005687,"sku":"Cali A3S Replace Pods - 1.0 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell-caliburn-a3s-replacement-pod-min_e7e1acd5-cb3d-4e8a-917c-80889a5670ec.jpg?v=1752511754"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-gt-core-coils-3-coils","title":"Vaporesso GT Core Coils (3 Coils)","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe Vaporesso  GT \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/replacement-vape-coils\" title=\"Vape Replacement Coils\"\u003eVape Replacement Coils \u003c\/a\u003epresents a dynamic coil option for the \u003cem\u003eNRG Sub-Ohm Tank and the Cascade Tank series\u003c\/em\u003e, deploying traditional cotton and signature cCelll Ceramic with it's innovative structure. The flagship coil head is the 0.15ohm GT 8 Core, with a quad-cylinder structure and wattage range of 50 to 110W. Comes in a pack of three (3).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eVaporesso NRG Tank (Includes all of the Revenger Kit series, SWAG Kit, and Switcher Kit)\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eVaporesso Cascade Tank (requires adapter)\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eVaporesso Cascade Baby Tank (Includes the Polar 220W Kit and Armour Pro Kit)\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eVaporesso Cascade Mini Tank\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eVaporesso Cascade One \/ One Plus Kit\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan data-sheets-userformat='{\"2\":4993,\"3\":[null,0],\"10\":2,\"11\":4,\"12\":0,\"15\":\"arial,sans,sans-serif\"}' data-sheets-value='{\"1\":2,\"2\":\"Vaporesso NRG GT Replacement Coils Features:\\nGT Cores Structure\\n0.3ohm GT cCell Core - rated for 25-40W\\n0.4ohm GT 2 Core - rated for 40-80W\\n0.15ohm GT 4 Core - rated for 30-70W\\n0.2ohm GT 6 Core - rated for 40-130W\\n0.15ohm GT 8 Core - rated for 50-110W\"}' data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVaporesso NRG GT Replacement Coils Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eComes in a pack of three (3).\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eGT Cores Structure\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e0.5ohm GT cCell Core - rated for 15-40W\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e0.3ohm GT cCell2 Core - rated for 35-40W\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e0.4ohm GT 2 Core - rated for 40-80W\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e0.15ohm GT 4 Core - rated for 30-70W\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cem\u003e0.15ohm GT 4 Mesh Core - rated for 30-90W\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e0.2ohm GT 6 Core - rated for 40-130W\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e0.15ohm GT 8 Core - rated for 50-110W\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e0.18ohm GT Mesh Core - rated for 50-90W\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"0.18ohm GT Mesh Coils","offer_id":41775212331063,"sku":"V GT Core Coils (3 Coils) o.18ohm GT Mesh Coil","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.15ohm GT 8 Core Coils","offer_id":41775212363831,"sku":"V GT Core Coils (3 Coils) o.15ohm GT 8 Core Coils","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.15ohm GT 4 Mesh Coils","offer_id":41775212396599,"sku":"V GT Core Coils (3 Coils) o.15 ohm GT 4 Mesh Coils","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.5ohm GT cCELL Coils","offer_id":41775212429367,"sku":"V GT Core Coils (3 Coils) 0.5 ohm GT cCell Coils","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.15ohm GT 4 Coils","offer_id":41775212494903,"sku":"V GT Core Coils (3 Coils) o.15ohm GT 4 Coils","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.4ohm GT 2 Coils","offer_id":41775212462135,"sku":"V GT Core Coils (3 Coils) o.4ohm GT 2 Coils","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0.2ohm GT 6 Coils","offer_id":41775212527671,"sku":"V GT Core Coils (3 Coils) o.2ohm GT 6 Coils","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0.3ohm GT cCELL2 Coils","offer_id":41775212560439,"sku":"V GT Core Coils (3 Coils) o.3ohm GT cCell2 coils","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_nrg_gt_replacement_coils_-_gt_4_coil.jpg?v=1752512237"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-swag-px80-replacement-pods","title":"Vaporesso Swag PX80 Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVaporesso Swag PX80 pod is compatible with Swag PX80 kit and packed with great features, c\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eartridge is compatible with GTX coils for ultra-smooth flavour. Vaporesso SWAG PX80 Pod can replace coil without emptying pod and adjust air inlets by rotating pod. What's more, SWAG PX80 Pod adopts quad leakage protection with a triple-silicon structure and e-juice self-circulating system.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eRefillable 4ml Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eLeakproof Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eBottom Filling\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAdjustable rotating airflow\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSupports Sub Ohm Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-gtx-replacement-coil-series\" title=\"Vaporesso GTX Coils\"\u003eCompatible With GTX Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775213510711,"sku":"V Swag PX80 Replace Pods","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso-swag-pod-min.jpg?v=1752512247"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-pm40-replacement-pods","title":"Vaporesso LUXE PM40 Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"richContent-root-CMO\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Vaporesso LUXE PM40 replacement Pods (2-Pack), featuring a 4.0mL refillable capacity, top-fill system, and is compatible with the GTX Coil Series. \u003cem\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"richContent-root-CMO\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e4.0mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eTop Fill System\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e2x Replacement Pods\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775213543479,"sku":"V Luxe PM40 Replace Pods","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Vaporesso-Luxe-PM40-Replacement-Pod-min.jpg?v=1752512250"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-x-xr-replacement-pod","title":"Vaporesso LUXE X Replacement Pod","description":"\u003cdiv\u003eThe Vaporesso Luxe X replacement pods are compatible with the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-x-kit\" title=\"Vaporesso Luxe X Kit\"\u003eVaporesso Luxe X,\u003c\/a\u003e Luxe X Pro, \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-xr-pod-kit\" title=\"Vaporesso Luxe XR Pod Kit\"\u003eLuxe XR\u003c\/a\u003e and Luxe XR Max vape kits. There are several different options to choose from, so no matter whether you prefer a discreet MTL (Mouth To Lung), balanced RDTL (Restricted Direct To Lung) or loose DTL (Direct To Lung) inhale, Vaporesso has you covered. The built-in coil pods offer more convenience as they require less maintenance, while the empty versions provide more flexibility as they can be paired with the full range of \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-gtx-replacement-coil-series\" title=\"Vaporesso Gtx Coils\"\u003eVaporesso GTX coils.\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRefillable 2ml Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-In Mesh Or Replaceable GTX Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDesigned For MTL, RDTL And DTL Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSS Leak-Resistant Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottom-Filling\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\nThe coils built into the Luxe pods feature a mesh build, so they’ll heat e-liquid quickly and evenly for improved flavour. The 0.4 Ohm Luxe X pod will deliver a DTL inhale and works best at 32W – pair it with 70% VG e-liquid for large amounts of vapour. Or, select the 0.8 Ohm Luxe X pod for an MTL vape as this pod works best at 16W and is ideal for 50% VG e-liquid.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"0.4 Ohm Mesh - Two Pack","offer_id":41775215411255,"sku":"V Luxe X Replace Pod - 0.4 ohm - Two Pack","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.6 Ohm Mesh - Two Pack","offer_id":41775215444023,"sku":"V Luxe X Replace Pod - 0.6 ohm - Two Pack","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.8 Ohm Mesh - Two Pack","offer_id":41775215476791,"sku":"V Luxe X Replace Pod - 0.8 ohm - Two Pack","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso-luxe-x-replacement-pods-0.8ohm-min.jpg?v=1752512516"},{"product_id":"caliburn-explorer-replacement-pods","title":"Caliburn Explorer Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn Explorer pods are designed for use with the Caliburn Explorer kit only. Featuring a unique split-pod design, these pods can hold two different e-liquids and coils at once, which can be vaped separately or together. Compatible with Caliburn G \u0026amp; G2 coils, these pods will deliver your choice of MTL (Mouth To Lung) or RDTL (Restricted Direct To Lung) inhale.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRefillable Pods For Caliburn Explorer\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml E-Liquid Capacity – 1ml Per Side\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide-Filling Design\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/uwell\" title=\"Uwell Kenya\"\u003eCompatible With Caliburn G \u0026amp; G2 Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSuited To 50\/50 And High PG E-Liquids\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach half of a Caliburn Explorer pod requires its own coil and e-liquid. This allows you to swap between two different flavours and coil resistances, or even vape both at once. To refill, simply open up the rubber stoppers on each side of the pod. The compatible coils from the Caliburn G and G2 series (sold separately) work best when paired with 50% VG or high PG e-liquid.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 x Caliburn Explorer Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775215542327,"sku":"Cali Explorer Replace Pods","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell-caliburn-explorer-replacement-pod-min.jpg?v=1752512527"}],"url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-coils-pods.oembed","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




